sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant F as Frontend
  participant C as Cognito
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>F: Start email login
  F->>C: Authorization code with PKCE
  C-->>F: Code callback
  F->>A: Access token
  A->>C: JWKS and issuer validation
  A->>D: Map Cognito sub
  D-->>A: User and role
  A-->>F: Protected response
